From 0de7d80d32a25bc146802f1b1488f9610f16575a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin Pfister <git@jjrpf.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:17:18 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 11/15] drm/asahi: warm restart the G14S GPU firmware across
 suspend-to-RAM

Keep the GPU bound over the sleep and restart its firmware after the wake.

Signed-off-by: Justin Pfister <git@jjrpf.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/driver.rs | 32 +++++++++++---
 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/gpu.rs    | 74 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/regs.rs   | 31 ++++++++++----
 3 files changed, 123 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

